  Text:
    m_Untranslated: With so many towers in your scene, the ball may once again have a hard time knocking all of the blocks over. But what would happen if the ball was ten times heavier? Or one hundred times heavier?
--- !u!114 &-2342701172940940617
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
